ed. Even though you write the predicate using a closure, the macro transforms that closure into a predicate when you compile. The code in the closure isn’t run as part of your program."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the predicate’s definition, you can use the following operations:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Arithmetic (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"+"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"%"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Unary minus (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Range (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"..."},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"..<"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Comparison (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<="},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":">"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":">="},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"=="},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"!="},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Ternary conditional (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"?:"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Conditional expressions","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Boolean logic (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"&&"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"||"},{"text":", ","typ